    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a hundred attack patterns to avoid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique stages with 4 minion encounters and 2 boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set high scores with tracked gameplay statistics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All original songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master teleport abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive tutorial</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Beats:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo always wondered why they felt different, why they always heard a head-thumping tune that no one else seemed to notice. One day, Echo tried to uncover the truth behind this  music that was becoming impossible to ignore. Only then did they discover how the  elite were hoarding this powerful and vibrant music to themselves in order to keep the masses in an aphonic state of order and obedience. All hope was not lost; there were others like Echo. It was time to rebel! Will you be able to help Echo in their quest to bring Rock to the people?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Team:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo Rift was developed by students from the University of Utah's Division of Games Masters' Program.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a hundred attack patterns to avoid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique stages with 4 minion encounters and 2 boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set high scores with tracked gameplay statistics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All original songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master teleport abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive tutorial</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Beats:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo always wondered why they felt different, why they always heard a head-thumping tune that no one else seemed to notice. One day, Echo tried to uncover the truth behind this  music that was becoming impossible to ignore. Only then did they discover how the  elite were hoarding this powerful and vibrant music to themselves in order to keep the masses in an aphonic state of order and obedience. All hope was not lost; there were others like Echo. It was time to rebel! Will you be able to help Echo in their quest to bring Rock to the people?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Team:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo Rift was developed by students from the University of Utah's Division of Games Masters' Program.</p>",
    "short_description": "Fight enemies to the beat and bring Rock to the people in this epic rhythm game! Echo Rift is a beat-based combat game where players dance on an arena grid in their fight against the audiocratic elite to bring back music to a silenced world.",
